    "Mer de filet belongs to a documented combined net/cabin ensemble; examine current Cabanes de Pokey before adding any historical entity.",
    "Construction/extension articles are stronger primary evidence than promotional lists, but do not map old courses to current numbered course IDs.",
    "The carriage is not the pedal Rosalie in the article illustration; Games/Tag and old/current food labels still require explicit identity evidence."
